{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905500/extras/20bdaa0a02d93e2b1444171c4406daa9.webp?t=1773659918\" width=838 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905500/extras/0d277b70ed8f4d6084e72ab2a355ceeb.poster.avif?t=1773659918\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905500/extras/0d277b70ed8f4d6084e72ab2a355ceeb.webm?t=1773659918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905500/extras/0d277b70ed8f4d6084e72ab2a355ceeb.mp4?t=1773659918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back in the land of your childhood, your royal mission is of the utmost importance: you must map the remote area and draw a border that will restore peace. Your observant eye, your analytical skills, and the measurements you take will be the only tools at your disposal for filling in your empty map.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905500/extras/996b23f189fa191f4ae0e299f787d8e4.webp?t=1773659918\" width=616 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905500/extras/689d70673467d811d389b95401f58c26.poster.avif?t=1773659918\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905500/extras/689d70673467d811d389b95401f58c26.webm?t=1773659918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905500/extras/689d70673467d811d389b95401f58c26.mp4?t=1773659918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether hostile or friendly, every person you come across will have a secret to tell you or a request to make. The consequences of defining a border between kingdoms are far-reaching, and you'll have to juggle the needs of the locals with your official duties.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905500/extras/6904e00a71cd56a164c756911472279e.webp?t=1773659918\" width=616 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905500/extras/f523e427adc0f46b321234cc50ab02a4.poster.avif?t=1773659918\" width=698 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905500/extras/f523e427adc0f46b321234cc50ab02a4.webm?t=1773659918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905500/extras/f523e427adc0f46b321234cc50ab02a4.mp4?t=1773659918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you continue your survey of the land, you'll start to notice strange phenomena and signs of a secret plot against you. There's much more here than just a map: your forgotten promises, your childhood sweetheart, the history of the land you stand on. Will your sketches bring peace or chaos?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905500?t=1773659918","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebac